
While Speedrun Ethereum is chain-agnostic, its modular architecture and developer tooling make it highly compatible with Base, Coinbase’s Layer 2 network. Builders can easily deploy their Speedrun projects to Base, benefiting from:

Low gas fees
Fast transaction finality
Strong developer support

This makes Speedrun Ethereum a perfect launchpad for dApps on Base, especially for developers looking to build scalable, user-friendly applications.
